    "name": "Attendance System API v1",
    "description": "Smoke and endpoint tests for the Attendance System API. Run against a disposable or staging database. The collection-level tests fail on HTTP 5xx responses. Run Fetch CSRF token first; login requests save tokens when successful. Supply tokens and IDs in the Postman environment for protected routes. Destructive attendance and deletion operations are disabled by default.",
